  "description": "“I’ll help you. With your love life.”\n\nCreak, creak—zero social skills! Kim Choi becomes the owner of the closed-off 'Second Library.' One day, her most hidden crush is discovered by the uncomfortable senior, Lee Do-jin, who breaks into the place. But this guy… what’s his ulterior motive? He offers to help with her crush, but the condition is that she date him?! Is it a deal, or is it ulterior motives? That summer, a very private youth romance unfolds in a secret place. \n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=852616), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14451474)",
